"The %lld selected commits" = "De %lld valgte commits";
"The branches and tags go back to the old commits — if none of them has moved since." = "Grenene og tags går tilbage til de gamle commits — hvis ingen af dem har flyttet sig siden.";
"The commit messages were last rewritten on %@. The old commits are kept so that it can be undone." = "Commit-beskederne blev sidst omskrevet %@. De gamle commits bevares, så det kan fortrydes.";
"The current branch" = "Den aktuelle gren";
"The history could not be read. Nothing was changed." = "Historikken kunne ikke læses. Intet blev ændret.";
"The message of %@ is not stored as UTF-8 and cannot be changed here." = "Beskeden i %@ er ikke gemt som UTF-8 og kan ikke ændres her.";
"The message of %@ would be empty. A commit needs a message." = "Beskeden i %@ ville være tom. Et commit kræver en besked.";
"The regular expression is not valid." = "Det regulære udtryk er ugyldigt.";
"The remote branches are replaced by the rewritten ones — with a lease: if somebody pushed to them since they were fetched, the push is refused instead." = "Fjerngrenene erstattes af de omskrevne — med lease: har nogen pushet til dem siden sidste fetch, afvises pushet i stedet.";
"The selected commit" = "Det valgte commit";
"There is no backup of that rewrite any more." = "Der findes ikke længere en sikkerhedskopi af den omskrivning.";
"This is about this repository only. Commits that were pushed may still be reachable at the server — through pull requests, forks or caches — and in every clone. A secret that was pushed has to be revoked or changed." = "Det gælder kun dette repository. Commits, der er pushet, kan stadig være tilgængelige på serveren — via pull requests, forks eller caches — og i hver klon. En hemmelighed, der er pushet, skal tilbagekaldes eller ændres.";
"Undo" = "Fortryd";
"Undo the rewrite of the commit messages?" = "Fortryd omskrivningen af commit-beskederne?";
"Undone: %@ are back on the old commits." = "Fortrudt: %@ står igen på de gamle commits.";
"Was: %@" = "Før: %@";
"Whole words" = "Hele ord";
"edited" = "redigeret";
"in %lld commit(s)" = "i %lld commit(s)";
"left as it is" = "ladt som det er";
"pushed." = "pushet.";
"%@ still has the old commits. Force-push the rewritten branches first; removing the old commits before that would make the force-push impossible." = "%@ har stadig de gamle commits. Gennemtving først push af de omskrevne grene; at fjerne de gamle commits før da ville gøre det gennemtvungne push umuligt.";
"A fetch is running in this repository. Try again when it has finished." = "Der kører et fetch i dette repository. Prøv igen, når det er færdigt.";
"only the newest %lld commits are searched" = "kun de nyeste %lld commits gennemsøges";
